          <td class="News"><a title="nakeDeb is a minimalist desktop Linux distribution based on Debian's &quot;Stable&quot; branch and designed for more advanced Linux users. By default it uses the Fluxbox window manager, although an alternative session with i3 is also available. The distribution provides a simple text-mode system installer and custom repositories with extra software, including various utilities and themes. It comes with the w3m web browser and a script to download and install the latest Tor Browser, and it also includes the PCManFM file manager and mpv media player. makeDeb offers support for French and English languages." href="nakedeb">nakeDeb</a> &bull; <a href="https://nakedeb.arpinux.org/download/nakedeb-1.6-202611-amd64.iso">1.6-202611</a></td>
