        <td class="NewsText" style="font-size: 15px">The <a href="deepin">deepin</a> project has published a new release with improved snapshot management, an updated kernel and an updated AI agent: "<span class="Quote">UOS AI gets a major upgrade - system-level intelligence for the Agent OS, within easy reach. Retrieve anything from your entire disk with a single sentence - every document on your computer becomes knowledge you can call on at any time. MCP, Skills, and dedicated agent capabilities now share a unified entry point, with UOS AI automatically dispatching whatever capability a task requires. The system takes the initiative, so your work moves faster. Significantly better stability and performance: new freeze protection keeps the taskbar, launcher and system monitor responsive even when the system is severely stalled. The control center home page loads far faster, and commonly used applications start quickly even under heavy load, so the system stays smooth over long-term use. Effortless system maintenance and data protection - snapshot and restore in the immutable system is more intuitive - snapshots can be saved to a local disk, USB drive, or portable hard drive, and restores can be started from a chosen location. PC Manager is now included in the image by default, combining detection, cleanup and repair in one place, making system maintenance as simple as a health check.</span>" Additional information can be found in the <a href="https://www.deepin.org/en/deepin-25-3-release/">release announcement</a>. <a href="https://www.deepin.org/en/download/">Download</a>: <a href="https://cdimage.deepin.com/releases/25.3.0/amd64/deepin-desktop-community-25.3.0-amd64.iso">deepin-desktop-community-25.3.0-amd64.iso</a> (6,897MB, <a href="https://cdimage.deepin.com/releases/25.3.0/amd64/SHA256SUMS">SHA256</a>, <a href="https://storage.deepin.org/static/v25/deepin-desktop-community-25.3.0-amd64.iso.torrent">torrent</a>, <a href="table.php?distribution=deepin&amp;pkgli